%% title: Daily FX Revaluation Flow (ADR-0046)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Scheduler as FxRevaluationScheduler\n(in-process cron)
    participant LedgerSvc as ledger-service
    participant FxSvc as fx-service\n(ČNB fixing)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as outbox table
    participant Kafka as Kafka\nopenbank.ledger.fx.revalued

    Note over Scheduler: Daily at EOD (22:00 CET)\nor manual trigger via\nPOST /api/v1/ledger/fx-revaluation

    Scheduler->>LedgerSvc: trigger revaluation(date)

    loop for each foreign currency (EUR, USD, GBP)
        LedgerSvc->>FxSvc: GET /api/v1/rates/{currency}/cnb?date={date}
        FxSvc-->>LedgerSvc: cnbFixingRate

        LedgerSvc->>DB: SELECT SUM(amount) FROM journal_lines\nWHERE gl_account_id = FX_POSITION_{CCY}\n(199x accounts)
        DB-->>LedgerSvc: currentFxPosition (in foreign CCY)

        LedgerSvc->>DB: SELECT current counter-value\nFROM journal_lines WHERE gl_account=199x-CV
        DB-->>LedgerSvc: previousCounterValueCZK

        LedgerSvc->>LedgerSvc: newCounterValue = position × cnbRate\ndelta = newCounterValue − previousCounterValue

        alt delta != 0
            LedgerSvc->>DB: BEGIN
            LedgerSvc->>DB: INSERT journal_entry (status=POSTED)\nDEBIT/CREDIT 199x-CV vs 5900\n(exchange rate differences, CZK only)
            LedgerSvc->>Outbox: INSERT FxRevalued event
            LedgerSvc->>DB: COMMIT
        end
    end

    Outbox->>Kafka: FxRevalued {date, currency, cnbRate,\npositionAmount, deltaAmountCZK}

    Note over LedgerSvc: Per-currency balancing invariant\n(ADR-0025) preserved:\nonly CZK legs (199x-CV + 5900)
